B.X0=new A.bv(B.N,"Canuckle is operated by Canuckle Games, based in Ottawa, Ontario, Canada. At Canuckle, we respect your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal information. This Privacy Policy explains what information may be collected when you visit canucklegame.ca or use Canuckle, Canuckle+, Canoku, and other games or features available through our website (collectively, the \u201cServices\u201d), how we use that information, and the choices available to you.",null)
